## Overview

This architecture enables safe, versioned plugin development with clear contracts, dependency isolation, and controlled lifecycle management. Five development teams can build plugins simultaneously with predictable behavior, breaking changes handled through explicit versioning, and sandboxed execution preventing plugin crashes from affecting the core system.

