### 12.1 Plugin Health & Observability

```typescript
interface PluginHealthReport {
  pluginId: string;
  status: PluginStatus;
  uptime: number; // ms
  resourceUsage: {
    memoryMb: number;
    cpuTimeMs: number;
    requestCount: number;
