## Appendix C: Manifest JSON Schema (Complete)

[Full JSON Schema Draft 7 available in separate file `plugin-manifest-schema.json`]

Key validation constraints:
- `id` matches `^[a-z0-9]([a-z0-9\-\.]*[a-z0-9])?$` (lowercase reverse domain)
- `version` matches semver `^(0|[1-9]\d*)\.(0|[1-9]\d*)\.(0|[1-9]\d*)(?:-((?:0|[1-9]\d*|\d*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*)(?:\.(?:0|[1-9]\d*|\d*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*))*))?(?:\+([0-9a-zA-Z-]+(?:\.[0-9a-zA-Z-]+)*))?$`
- `minApiVersion` and `maxApiVersion` must be semver and span max 3 major versions
- All paths must be relative (no absolute paths)
- No external URLs except in metadata fields

