## 6. Versioned API Contract

### 6.1 API Versioning Strategy

TTAK uses **semantic versioning** for its host API surface. Plugins declare compatibility via manifest `compatibility.ttak` field.

```typescript
interface TtakHostAPI {
  // Version metadata
  __version: '3.1.0';
  __apiVersion: '1.0';

  // Core interfaces (stable)
  reports: IReportAPI;
  data: IDataAPI;
  config: IConfigAPI;

  // Beta interfaces (subject to change)
  $beta: {
    visualization: IVisualizationAPI;
    // $beta features removed in next major version
  };
}

interface VersionContract {
  major: number;      // Breaking changes
  minor: number;      // New features, backward-compatible
  patch: number;      // Bug fixes only

  removedAt?: {
    majorVersion: number;
    deprecatedSince: string;
    migrationGuide: string;
  };
}
```

### 6.2 API Surface Specification

```typescript
// Report API (v1.0 stable)
interface IReportAPI {
  generate(spec: ReportGenerationSpec): Promise<Report>;
  list(filter?: ReportFilter): Promise<Report[]>;
  delete(reportId: string): Promise<void>;

