## 12. Migration & Upgrade Path

### 12.1 API Deprecation Process

```
Release N: New API introduced (v1.0-beta)
  ↓
Release N+1: API stable (v1.0)
  ↓
Release N+2: API marked deprecated (with migration guide)
  └─ Plugins using old API receive warnings
  ↓
Release N+3: Old API removed
  └─ Plugins fail to load until updated
```

### 12.2 Plugin Compatibility Matrix

| Plugin API | TTAK 3.0 | TTAK 3.1 | TTAK 3.2 | TTAK 4.0 |
|-----------|----------|----------|----------|----------|
| v1.0      | ✓        | ✓        | ✓        | ✗        |
| v1.1      | ✗        | ✓        | ✓        | ✓        |
| v2.0      | ✗        | ✗        | ✓        | ✓        |

Plugins targeting TTAK 3.0-3.2 must upgrade to API v1.0. TTAK 4.0 requires v1.1+.

