## 6. Versioned API Contract

### 6.1 API Versioning Strategy

Plugins target a major.minor API version. Breaking changes introduce new major versions; old versions remain available.

```
API v1.0 (Deprecated 2026-12-31)
  ├─ report.render(data) → Report
  ├─ report.validate(data) → ValidationResult

API v2.0 (Current)
  ├─ report.render(data, options) → Report
  ├─ report.validate(data, options) → ValidationResult
  ├─ report.schedule(definition) → ScheduledReport  [NEW]

API v2.1 (Latest)
  ├─ report.render(data, options, context) → Report  [CHANGED]
  ├─ report.validate(data, options) → ValidationResult
  ├─ report.schedule(definition, triggers) → ScheduledReport  [CHANGED]
  ├─ report.export(format, data) → ExportResult  [NEW]
```

