## 13. Plugin Compatibility Matrix

| Tool Version | API Version | Supports |
|--------------|-------------|----------|
| 2.0.x        | 1.0.0       | Plugins with apiVersion ≤ 1.0.0 |
| 2.1.x        | 1.1.0       | Plugins with apiVersion ≤ 1.1.0 |
| 2.2.x        | 1.2.0       | Plugins with apiVersion ≤ 1.2.0 |
| 3.0.x        | 2.0.0       | Plugins with apiVersion ≤ 2.0.0 (v1.x deprecated) |

**Guarantees:**
- Tool v2.1.x loads v1.0.0 plugins without modification
- Tool v2.2.x loads v1.0.0 and v1.1.0 plugins
- Tool v3.0.x requires explicit migration of v1.x plugins

