## 16. Non-Functional Requirements

| Requirement | Target | Measurement |
|-------------|--------|-------------|
| Plugin Isolation | 100% | Failure in one plugin doesn't affect others |
| API Stability | 5+ years | Breaking changes only at major versions |
| Load Time | < 2s | Per plugin in isolation |
| Memory Overhead | < 50MB | Per plugin instance |
| Unload Safety | 100% | No dangling resources or memory leaks |
| Hook Timeout | Configurable | Default 30s, enforced per sandbox |
| Developer Onboarding | < 2 hours | From init to working example |

