### Resource Limits

```typescript
interface ResourceLimits {
  maxPlugins: number;                    // e.g., 50
  maxWorkersPerPlugin: number;           // e.g., 1
  memoryPerPlugin: number;               // e.g., 256MB
  cpuSharePerPlugin: number;             // e.g., 0.5 (50% of one core)
  callTimeout: number;                   // e.g., 30s
  maxConcurrentCalls: number;            // e.g., 100
}

