## Architecture Overview

### System Design Principles
- **Isolation**: Plugins run in isolated contexts; failures don't crash the host
- **Explicit Contracts**: API changes require version bumps; no silent breaking changes
- **Progressive Loading**: Plugins load on-demand; no startup penalties
- **Observable**: Full lifecycle logging; plugins are introspectable from the host
- **Versioned**: Host and plugins negotiate compatible API versions at load time

