## Plugin Registry

The registry is the source of truth for all plugins: their metadata, state, dependencies, and capabilities.

### Registry Data Model

```typescript
class PluginRegistry {
  // Primary storage: pluginId -> plugin metadata & state
  private plugins: Map<string, PluginEntry>

  // Capability index: capabilityName -> [pluginId]
  private capabilities: Map<string, Set<string>>

  // Dependency graph for efficient querying
  private dependencyGraph: DirectedGraph<string>

  // Version compatibility matrix
