## Architecture Overview

### System Architecture

```
┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                   Plugin Execution Layer                        │
│  ┌─────────────┐  ┌─────────────┐  ┌──────────────┐            │
│  │  Plugin A   │  │  Plugin B   │  │  Plugin C    │            │
│  │  (Worker)   │  │  (VM)       │  │(In-Process)  │            │
│  └─────┬───────┘  └──────┬──────┘  └──────┬───────┘            │
├────────┼──────────────────┼────────────────┼────────────────────┤
│  Sandbox Boundary & Resource Enforcement                        │
│  • CPU/Memory limits   • Permission enforcement                 │
│  • Network policy      • File I/O sandboxing                    │
├───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│   Plugin Manager (Registry, Lifecycle, Dependencies)             │
├───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│   Versioned Host API (v2.0 Stable + v3.0 Preview)               │
├───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│   Core Reporting Engine                                          │
└───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

### Core Responsibilities

| Component | Owns |
|-----------|------|
| **Manifest** | Declares what plugin does, needs, how it behaves |
| **Registry** | Discovery, state tracking, dependency graph, capabilities |
| **Lifecycle Manager** | Load/unload/reload orchestration, hook execution |
| **Sandbox Manager** | Execution isolation, resource enforcement, API proxying |
| **Versioned Host API** | Stable contracts, deprecation tracking, routing |
| **Dependency Resolver** | Topological sort, conflict detection |
| **Event Bus** | Plugin inter-communication, host notifications |
| **Audit Logger** | Security events, compliance, debugging |

