## Lifecycle Management

Strict five-phase lifecycle with defined hooks.

### Lifecycle Phases

```
DISCOVERING → VALIDATING → RESOLVED → LOADING → INITIALIZING → LOADED → ACTIVATING → ACTIVE
                                                                    ↓ (deactivate)
                                                                UNLOADING → UNLOADED
                                                                    ↑
                                                              (cleanup hook)

(Any state) → ERROR → (retry/disable/unload)
```

### Plugin Hooks API

```typescript
interface PluginHooks {
  // Required: Called on load
  init(context: PluginContext): Promise<void>

  // Required: Called on unload
  cleanup(): Promise<void>

  // Optional: Activation/deactivation
  activate?(): Promise<void>
  deactivate?(): Promise<void>

  // Optional: Config and dependency changes
  onConfigChange?(config: Record<string, any>): Promise<void>
  onDependencyReady?(pluginId: string): Promise<void>
  onDependencyUnloading?(pluginId: string): Promise<void>

  // Optional: Error handling
  onError?(error: Error): Promise<void>
  healthCheck?(): Promise<HealthStatus>
}

interface PluginContext {
  id: string
  version: string
  config: Record<string, any>
  permissions: Permission[]
  hostAPI: VersionedHostAPI         // Typed API with versioning
  logger: StructuredLogger
  storage: PersistentStorage
  eventBus: EventEmitter
  dependencies: {
    get(pluginId: string): any
    require(pluginId: string): Promise<any>
  }
}
```

### Lifecycle Manager

```typescript
class LifecycleManager {
  // Load plugin: discover → validate → resolve → load → init
  async load(manifest: PluginManifest, path: string): Promise<PluginInstance>

  // Activate: prepare for requests
  async activate(pluginId: string): Promise<void>

  // Deactivate: graceful shutdown
  async deactivate(pluginId: string): Promise<void>

  // Unload: cleanup and release resources
  async unload(pluginId: string): Promise<void>

  // Hot reload: unload and reload without restart
  async hotReload(pluginId: string): Promise<void>

  // Graceful system shutdown
  async shutdown(): Promise<void>
}
```

