### **9. Security Model**

| Layer | Mechanism |
|-------|-----------|
| **Declaration** | Manifest declares all needs upfront (capabilities, permissions) |
| **Validation** | JSON schema + semantic checks (cyclic deps, version compat) |
| **Runtime Enforcement** | Capability gating, permission checking, resource limits |
| **Secrets** | Accessed only via secrets API; never in config/logs; audit-logged |
| **Audit** | All permission denials, secret access, errors logged with context |
| **Rollback** | Plugin versioning allows atomic per-plugin rollback |

