## 🚨 Error Codes Reference

| Code | Meaning | Recovery |
|------|---------|----------|
| MANIFEST_INVALID | Manifest fails schema | Fix manifest JSON |
| LOAD_FAILED | Module loading error | Check file paths, syntax |
| HOOK_ERROR | Hook threw exception | Debug hook code |
| API_INCOMPATIBLE | API version mismatch | Use compatible API version |
| PERMISSION_DENIED | Permission check failed | Declare permission in manifest |
| SANDBOX_VIOLATION | Resource limit exceeded | Reduce memory usage or increase limit |
| DEPENDENCY_UNMET | Missing/incompatible dependency | Install dependency with correct version |

