## 2. Plugin Manifest Schema

Every plugin declares `manifest.json` defining its contract:

```json
{
  "apiVersion": "v1",
  "kind": "ReportingPlugin",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "team-acme:report-exporter",
    "displayName": "ACME Report Exporter",
    "version": "2.1.0",
    "author": {"name": "Team ACME", "email": "acme@company.com"}
  },
  "spec": {
    "compatibility": {
      "hostVersion": ">=1.0.0 <2.0.0",
      "apiVersion": ">=v1 <v3"
    },
    "entryPoint": {
      "module": "dist/index.js",
      "mainClass": "ReportExporter"
    },
    "capabilities": [
      {
        "id": "report.export.pdf",
        "version": "v1",
        "requires": ["report.read"],
        "riskLevel": "medium"
      }
    ],
    "dependencies": {
      "plugins": [
        {"name": "reporting-core", "version": ">=1.0.0 <2.0.0"}
      ]
    },
    "hooks": {
      "load": {"timeout": 5000, "critical": true},
      "enable": {"timeout": 2000, "critical": false},
      "disable": {"timeout": 2000, "critical": false},
      "unload": {"timeout": 3000, "critical": true}
    },
    "permissions": {
      "api": ["report.read", "event.publish"],
      "system": {
        "maxMemory": "256MB",
        "maxCpuTime": 30000,
        "maxNetworkRequests": 100
      },
      "network": {
        "allowedDomains": ["api.company.com"],
        "allowedPorts": [80, 443]
      }
    },
    "configuration": {
      "schema": {
        "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#",
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {"apiKey": {"type": "string"}},
        "required": ["apiKey"]
      }
    }
  }
}
```

**Validation Rules:**
- Required: `apiVersion`, `kind`, `metadata.name`, `metadata.version`, `spec.entryPoint`
- Semantic versioning format (MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH)
- Capabilities with unique IDs and risk levels
- Network/file access explicit and allowlisted

