3. Security check
    ├─ Verify signature
    ├─ Check permissions
    └─ Apply policies
    ↓
4. Initialize sandbox
    ├─ Allocate worker/process
    ├─ Set limits
    └─ Setup boundaries
    ↓
5. Load code
    ├─ Require module
    ├─ Inject context
    └─ Setup logging
    ↓
6. Transition: LOADING → LOADED
    ↓
7. Execute onLoad() hook
    ├─ Plugin initialization
    ├─ Timeout enforcement
    └─ Rollback on error
    ↓
8. Register subscriptions
    ├─ Event handlers
    └─ RPC endpoints
    ↓
Success: Plugin LOADED
```

### Plugin Reload Sequence

```
User: reloadPlugin("team-acme:report-exporter")
    ↓
1. If ENABLED → Disable
    ├─ Execute onDisable()
    └─ Timeout enforcement
    ↓
2. Unload
    ├─ Execute onUnload()
    ├─ Persist state
    └─ Cleanup resources
    ↓
3. Reload manifest (detect version changes)
    ↓
4. [REPEAT: Plugin Load Sequence]
    ↓
Success: Plugin reloaded and re-enabled
```

### Error Recovery

```
Runtime: Plugin crashes during execution
    ↓
1. Catch exception
    ├─ Capture stack
    ├─ Record correlation ID
    └─ Terminate sandbox
    ↓
2. Log error with context
    ↓
3. Transition: ENABLED → ERROR
    ↓
4. Emit "plugin:error" event
    ↓
5. Recovery:
   a) Auto-recovery (transient errors)
      ├─ Wait 5s
      ├─ Attempt reload
      ├─ Resume if successful
      └─ Quarantine if 3+ failures

   b) Manual recovery
      ├─ Admin notified
      └─ pluginManager.recover(pluginId)
    ↓
Success or escalation
```

