## Summary: Core Takeaways

| Component | Key Design |
|-----------|-----------|
| **Manifest** | JSON Schema with SemVer constraints, capability declarations, resource limits |
| **Registry** | Versioned storage; discovery via metadata; integrity verification |
| **Lifecycle** | State machine with hooks (load/ready/unload/reload); required health checks |
| **Sandbox** | Worker-based isolation; capability-gated API access; resource enforcement |
| **Versioning** | API versions (v1, v2, etc); breaking changes require new version; negotiation at load time |
| **Distribution** | Signed packages; checksum verification; integrity chains |
